        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-406 (ensure controlled execution — Store Closure Decision &amp; Planning (PA-59.1).) | - operational: capex/financial-commitment approval — links to VS-40; operational: CFO sign-off on the business case
Owner: FP&amp;A Director</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2263_Assoc7" sourceRef="W2263_Annotation6" targetRef="W2263_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
