      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Closure approved
Frequency: Per closure (~2–3/year)
Volume: ~2–3 plans/year
Owner: VP Corporate Communications
Participants: VP Corp Comms, Legal, HR, Marketing, CEO
Source: workflow W2265 — Store Closure Communication Plan</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2265_LaneSet2">
