      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Closure approved
Frequency: Per closure
Volume: ~15K–30K unique transacting customers per store (not master records; the chain customer master is ~600K per W405)
Owner: Loyalty Program Manager
Participants: Loyalty Manager, Marketing, VP Marketing
Source: workflow W2267 — Customer Migration Planning</bpmn:documentation>
