      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2267_Task4" name="Analyzes customer base: active members, frequency, nearest alternative store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Analyzes customer base: active members, frequency, nearest alternative store; develops redirect communications; Marketing executes migration campaign with welcome offer at new store
Responsible (R): Loyalty Manager / Marketing
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: 3–5 days + 2–3 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2267_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
