        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Files: LGU permit cancellation, BIR branch closure, DOLE 30-day notice, SSS/PhilHealth/Pag-IBIG update; Finance settles final taxes; HR ensures statutory compliance; Legal retains records 10 years
Responsible (R): Legal / Finance / HR
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1–2 weeks + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2269_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
